        "gg9Ti_RVJxR_text": "<p>Dr. Amy Shah</p>",
        "ggAj09BhJ1i_text": "<p>CMO of Fountain Life & Integrative Oncologist at Mayo Clinic</p>",
        "ggIJ_ub30kT_text": "<p>Our Scientific Advisory Board brings together leading experts in nutrition, medicine, and performance science. This distinguished team has collaborated to develop a formula that represents the cutting edge of nutritional science.</p>",
