    "gp_section_604089461076132513": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "380347b37da343ed4192cba1761846dc519f77825e27362daf99de45d113d6fc_1_1_0_0__1",
        "gg98oD0o4PA_text": "<p>DAVID BECKHAM</p>",
        "ggAxwO677bJ_text": "<p>David Beckham<br>Co-Founding Partner</p>",
        "ggK8O9jHEhA_text": "<p>Supplements have been a part of my daily routine for years, but I’ve often felt overwhelmed by how many different products it takes to truly support your body. That’s why IM8 is so different — it’s simplified everything for me.</p>",
        "ggVZfPomvcv_text": "<p>I’ve shared IM8 with my friends and family, and everyone’s felt the difference — whether it’s more energy, better sleep or just feeling healthier overall.</p>",
        "ggjGVf2vpfL_text": "<p>Since taking IM8 daily, I’ve genuinely felt better — more energy, better focus, and just a stronger sense of overall wellness. And one of the best parts? It tastes amazing — like a refreshing blend of acai and mixed berries. It’s something I look forward to drinking every morning.</p>",
        "ggsLtPyPLy1_text": "<p>A NOTE FROM</p>",
        "ggwe9zl3ZY5_text": "<p>I’ve been fortunate to work with some of the world’s top medical professionals, nutrition experts, and fitness coaches throughout my life. Their guidance has always been crucial to my health. Since retiring from football, I’ve focused even more on eating well and staying informed about the latest science in health and supplements.</p>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-604089461076132513"
    },
