        "ggfqeozeFKB_text": "<p>Professional Volleyball Player</p>",
        "ggqCb4CqsWT_text": "<p>“As a pharmacist and fitness enthusiast, I know the importance of science and practicality. IM8 gives me the daily support I need to balance my health and strength routines seamlessly.”</p>",
        "ggzawW3GPZI_text": "<p>Doctor of Pharmacy & Wellness Coach</p>",
