      "settings": {
        "checksum": "1e700dc22c5f51de4ddf8eda29e8e27a6d1f861234c839543628caf42a289769_1_1_0_0__1",
        "gg5ng8ilCAl_text": "<p>Ingredients Spotlight: The Power Behind IM8</p>",
        "gg6W3KbQpgs_text": "<p>DR. DAWN MUSSALLEM, Integrative Oncologist at Mayo Clinic</p>",
        "gg7pc2vexdr_text": "<p>Probiotics</p>",
        "gg8r01qZfnV_text": "<p>Joint and Muscle Support</p>",
        "ggD4VC_Gk3G_text": "<p>MSM (Methylsulfonylmethane) is a naturally occurring sulfur compound that supports joint flexibility, muscle recovery, and overall connective tissue health. At 1,000mg, IM8 provides a clinical dose for optimal benefit.</p>",
        "ggL9ybwtIWP_text": "<p>Heart Health Support</p>",
        "ggM_yMNMu3S_text": "<p>Digestive Health</p>",
        "ggOGOGK3a9-_text": "<p>Our formula contains 92 carefully selected ingredients, each chosen for specific health benefits. Here’s a closer look at some of our key components:</p>",
        "ggTy0rWZHI3_text": "<p>IM8 includes clinically studied probiotic strains to support digestive health, immune function, and nutrient absorption for a healthier gut microbiome.</p>",
        "ggcWGkuroHW_text": "<p>Coenzyme Q10 is a powerful antioxidant that plays a crucial role in cellular energy production, particularly in the heart. IM8 includes a clinical dose of 100mg to support cardiovascular function and overall energy levels.</p>",
        "ggp4mPm23z6_text": "<p>MSM (1,000mg)</p>",
        "ggrW6WQb6co_text": "<p>PROF. SUZANNE DEVKOTA, Director of Cedars-Sinai Human Microbiome Research Institute</p>",
        "ggtKi3cZ6ev_text": "<p>CoQ10 (100mg)</p>",
        "ggw1NkxPC4e_text": "<p>DR. JAMES DINICOLANTONIO, Cardiovascular Research Scientist and Doctor of Pharmacy</p>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-604089461160018593"
    },
    "gp_section_604089461160084129": {
