        "gg-rTSXO4rX_text": "<p>Add one scoop of Daily Ultimate Essentials to 8-12 oz of cold water.</p>",
        "gg8Jm52LKhg_text": "<p>Most users report noticeable improvements in energy and digestion within the first week, with comprehensive benefits developing over 4-8 weeks of daily use.</p>",
        "gg9EStUbCfl_text": "<p>CONSISTENCY IS KEY</p>",
        "ggIPYFtGyjd_text": "<p>03</p>",
        "ggMkFaMbsuN_text": "<p>Drink daily, preferably in the morning, to fuel your body and mind.</p>",
        "ggP7w8irNe-_text": "<p>Feel the difference as your body receives optimal nutrition day after day.</p>",
        "ggX35H48yAN_text": "<p>ENJOY</p>",
        "ggXTlnUB1QS_text": "<p>MIX</p>",
