        "gg-Y2TD3FCI_text": "<p>★★★★★</p>",
        "ggHbLN39MCb_text": "<p>Erika Friesenhahn., Verified Customer</p>",
        "ggIgFnwp_Wh_text": "<p>Charlie West., Verified Customer</p>",
        "ggJ_noEC8fK_text": "<p>Bernae VeraKruse., Verified Customer</p>",
        "ggL_-k2zhL4_text": "<p>The taste is so delicious and I’m excited to feel the difference. I have tried AG1 but had terrible stomach upset with it and had to discontinue. Fingers crossed this one is better.</p>",
        "ggU924qHq5t_text": "<p>These are actual IM8 verified customers that have seen successful health outcomes with the consistent use of IM8 Daily Ultimate Essentials.</p>",
        "ggUEgjtdd1f_text": "<p>★★★★★</p>",
        "ggVNX1uP4Uw_text": "<p>I absolutely love IM8. I see a difference with my gut health and immune system. I have been spreading the word about this great product. Thank you for reaching out!</p>",
        "ggXKU9ZiH4U_text": "<p>Trina Fautoux., Verified Customer</p>",
        "ggcQ7aNo-7f_text": "<p>★★★★★</p>",
        "gggOt9F1jRn_text": "<p>★★★★★</p>",
