        "ggrhIkP6Gxi_text": "<p>10,000+ 5 Star Reviews</p>",
        "ggvy5BPaluE_text": "<p>I love it. I have a lot more energy. I am recommending it to all my friends. It is so nice to have almost everything I take in one drink.</p>"
